        <Geometry x:Key="SparkleGeometry">M9,5 C9.7,9.4 10.6,11.3 15,13 C10.6,14.7 9.7,16.6 9,21 C8.3,16.6 7.4,14.7 3,13 C7.4,11.3 8.3,9.4 9,5 Z M18,2 C18.3,4.2 18.8,4.7 21,5 C18.8,5.3 18.3,5.8 18,8 C17.7,5.8 17.2,5.3 15,5 C17.2,4.7 17.7,4.2 18,2 Z</Geometry>
